OL,3,APolanski defends leadership after
OL,4,AZionism row and by-election loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has defended his
OL,7,Fleadership of the Greens, after senior
OL,8,Fparty figures criticised his response
OL,9,Fto a motion passed by members declaring
OL,10,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,12,FSpeaking after coming second to Labour
OL,13,Fin the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,14,Fby-election, Polanski said he would
OL,15,Fstay on as Green leader, telling
OL,16,Fbroadcasters: "Yes I've taken a loss
OL,17,Ftonight but our movement is so much
OL,18,Fbigger than one election or one
OL,19,Fmotion."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
