OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, with
OL,5,Aauthor due to speak to BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is a risk of people being
OL,8,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism, an
OL,9,Fofficial review in England says
OL,11,FA rise in diagnoses over the past 25
OL,12,Fyears means cases now appear to be
OL,13,Foutstripping the expected number in the
OL,14,Fpopulation for some younger age groups,
OL,15,Fexperts say
OL,17,FThe review looked at people of all
OL,18,Fages, but particularly focused on young
OL,19,Fpeople and children who have the
OL,20,Fhighest rates of diagnoses
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
