OL,3,AFiring squad execution to be
OL,4,Alivestreamed, Pentagon says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is believed it would be the first
OL,7,Fpublic execution in the US in almost a
OL,8,Fcentury. The decision to livestream it
OL,9,Fis "unprecedented in the modern era"
OL,10,Fand "on uncertain legal terrain," said
OL,11,FJohn Mills, a lawyer who works with
OL,12,Finmates sentenced to death.
OL,14,F"We'll make sure that people are able
OL,15,Fto watch it, that it's public," Hegseth
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
